# system-details cli-not-root ----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Inferred from origin/main (unreleased). hardn system-details$
# as alice, not through sudo: reachable, as the subcommand has$
# no root check (cmd/hardn/main.go:84; the check at :148 is in$
# the root command's Run). The main menu and -p are not. What it$
# cannot read it says: /etc/sudoers.d is drwxr-x--- root root,$
# so a user cannot list it; on a doas host /etc/doas.conf, 0640$
# root (vm-runs/s1/01-tools.log); /etc/sudoers is 0440 (vm-$
# runs/s1/10-forms.log). So a user's row reads Not known, never$
# a group's guess. Last Login reads the same, run (vm-$
# runs/s1/02-login.log). The two lines above the report are$
# main()'s, unrelated, on stderr, so hardn system-details > file$
# holds the report alone (cmd/hardn/main.go, logging.go; read,$
# not run).$
$
      Failed to open log file /var/log/hardn.log: open$
      | /var/log/hardn.log: permission denied$
      Warning: Unable to create example configuration file:$
      | failed to create directory for example config: mkdir$
      | /etc/hardn: permission denied$
$
# System Details ###############################################$
$
# OS and Kernel ------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  OS                   Debian 13 (Trixie)$
   -  Kernel               6.12.113+deb13-cloud-amd64$
   -  Uptime               3 days, 5 hours, 12 minutes$
$
# Host and IPs -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Hostname             web-01$
   -  eth0                 192.0.2.20/24$
$
# Users --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [?] alice                Not known$
   -  Not root: /etc/sudoers, /etc/sudoers.d not read$
$
# CPU and Load -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Model                QEMU Virtual CPU version 2.5+$
   -  CPUs                 4, 1 socket$
   -  Load (1, 5, 15 min)  0.12, 0.08, 0.03$
$
# Disk ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  /                    /dev/vda1 ext4$
   -  Used                 4.2 of 38.6 GiB (11%)$
$
# Memory -------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Used                 1.2 of 3.8 GiB (30%)$
$
# Last Login ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  root                 None recorded$
   -  alice                Oct 20 11:42 from 192.0.2.10$
$
$

